        "message": "fix(cua-driver): batch Windows foreground multiline input\n\nSplit explicit pid/window foreground text into bounded Unicode and Return batches. Recheck target and editor admission before each batch, and report partial delivery without replay. Add WPF and WinUI3 application-state oracles and focused coverage.",
